- [ ] Selected / disabled / busy state is announced, not just coloured
- [ ] Text scaling at 200% does not clip or overlap
- [ ] Errors announced (`accessibilityLiveRegion`)
- [ ] Nothing essential depends on hover
- [ ] Reduced motion respected

